### Security Standards
- Store private keys in environment variables only
- Use secure file permissions (600) for config files
- Implement transaction simulation before execution
- Add maximum trade size limits
- Never log sensitive data

### Testing Requirements
@testing_standards [
  {
    "id": "unit_tests",
    "requirement": "Test all trading logic with mocked dependencies",
    "coverage": "Minimum 80% for core modules"
  },
  {
    "id": "integration_tests",
    "requirement": "Test API integrations with recorded responses",
    "tool": "pytest with pytest-asyncio"
  },
  {
    "id": "devnet_tests",
    "requirement": "Full end-to-end testing on devnet before mainnet",
    "duration": "Minimum 24 hours"
  }
]

### Performance Optimization
- Cache token metadata to reduce API calls
- Batch RPC requests where possible
- Use connection pooling for HTTP clients
- Implement proper resource cleanup

### Monitoring and Logging
